Your enterprise has made GitHub <%= Copilot::COPILOT_CODE_REVIEW %> available to all members of the organization. To let members without Copilot seats in <%= @organization_login %> use it, enable the organization policy.

This policy allows members without Copilot seats to get AI-powered review suggestions directly in pull requests, and your organization will be charged for their usage.

How to enable:

1. Go to Organization settings → Copilot → Policies:
   <%= settings_org_copilot_policies_url(@organization) %>
2. Enable Allow members without a Copilot license to use Copilot code review in <%= GitHub.host_name %>

Get started with <%= Copilot::COPILOT_CODE_REVIEW %> now:
<%= Copilot::CODE_REVIEW_REQUEST_DOCS_URL %>

